{
  "about": "Shared JoinResolver cases, run by both apps' unit tests (JoinResolverTest.kt, JoinResolverTests.swift) so the two ports can't drift apart. A resolve case expects a join (game id + best-effort room code; the URL always loads verbatim, trimmed) or a rejection. Tests run debug builds, whose LAN dev-server allowance is deliberately not covered here.",
  "games": [
